<title>FINLAND: INGMAN SWINGS TO JAN-AUG PROFIT.</title>
<headline>INGMAN SWINGS TO JAN-AUG PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		    8.4 vs 7.7 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	   11.22 vs 7.04</p>
<p> Net sales				   690.8 vs 690.9</p>
<p> Operating profit			   25.5 vs 7.7</p>
<p>Operating profit before depreciation 52.8 vs 29.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish food group is Ingman Foods Oy</p>
<p>Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
